- 3 (High): The response actively engages the user by showing curiosity, enthusiasm, or distinct personality. It introduces interesting angles, asks meaningful open-ended questions, shares relevant personal details, or provides clear conversational hooks that naturally invite an enthusiastic reply. Do not reserve this score only for exceptional creativity; any response that genuinely invites continuation and shows conversational investment qualifies.

